    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在给定增益下，K_v=2 sec^{-1}，但需要 K_v=10 sec^{-1}。自主估计器不改变 K_v；误差控制法会在未知位置引入零点；结合 Truxal 公式的零点配置法可同时满足动态和稳态要求。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "With the given gain, K_v=2 sec^{-1}, but K_v=10 sec^{-1} is needed. The autonomous estimator does not change K_v; the error-control method introduces a zero at an unknown location; the zero-placement method with Truxal's formula can satisfy both dynamic and steady-state requirements.",
